## Output bundle

`data_reference/` is the committed bundle the scenario emits.
A conformant implementation must reproduce it byte-for-byte:

```
data_reference/
  universe/       claims + content blobs (content-addressed)
  branches/B_h    id of the current contribution/branches claim
  ids.txt         sorted set of every id in the closure
```

## Verify

```
make verify-scenarios
```

Expected head id is hardcoded in `main.go` as `expectedMainHead`;
`s.ReloadAndVerify` re-opens the bundle, walks every closure, and
asserts the match.

